  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "klines-gateio",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGate.io USDT OHLCV Klines\n\t\n\nHistorical OHLCV candlestick (kline) data for Gate.io USDT-quoted markets,\nstored as zstd-compressed Parquet.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCoverage\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\nExchange\nGate.io\n\n\nMarkets\nspot (primary) \u00b7 futures (USDT perpetuals \u2014 limited history, see Notes)\n\n\nTimeframes\n5m \u00b7 15m \u00b7 1h \u00b7 4h \u00b7 1d (all pairs) \u2014 plus 1m for a ~1.3k-pair subset\n\n\nPairs\n~3,300 spot USDT pairs\n\n\nHistory\nspot back to 2013 for the oldest listings\n\n\nAs of\nstatic snapshot (~2025-05); periodic\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rogerdehe/klines-gateio.",
  "alternateName": [
    "rogerdehe/klines-gateio",
    "Gate.io USDT OHLCV Klines"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "rogerdehe",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/rogerdehe"
